# Remains of the WebAssembly approach the browser edition replaced. 31 MB in
# total, referenced by nothing but the tool that generates the first one. They
# are kept out of history on purpose: committing them is irreversible, and a
# repository that costs 31 MB to clone for files nobody loads is a repository
# people stop cloning. Regenerate with tools/build-offline-assets.js if the
# runtime is ever needed again.
